              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: 151\n\n**Preconditions:**\nAdmin permissions to create a sharepoint site\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\nPublish a SharePoint news article (not a file) and share it via Mail.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nIt should be displayed as in the article itself.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nHeader is messed up in the preview and in the mail.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The issue is believed to be valid, but was not reproduced as QA does not have permissions on the test account to create a sharepoint website\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/221931",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: 151\n\n**Preconditions:**\nAdmin permissions to create a sharepoint site\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\nPublish a SharePoint news article (not a file) and share it via Mail.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nIt should be displayed as in the article itself.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nHeader is messed up in the preview and in the mail.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The issue is believed to be valid, but was not reproduced as QA does not have permissions on the test account to create a sharepoint website\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/221931",
